    {"name": "Moules-frites", "name_en": "Mussels and Fries", "name_fr": "Moules-frites", "name_es": "Mejillones con patatas fritas", "description": "Cozze cotte in casseruola con vino bianco, sedano, cipolla ed erbe, servite con patatine fritte due volte. Il brodo deve restare aromatico e le cozze morbide, mentre le frites danno il contrasto croccante.", "description_en": "Mussels steamed with white wine, celery, onion and herbs, served with twice-fried chips. The broth should stay aromatic and the mussels tender, while the fries provide a crisp contrast.", "description_fr": "Moules cuites au vin blanc, céleri, oignon et herbes, servies avec des frites à double cuisson. Le jus doit rester parfumé, les moules tendres et les frites croustillantes.", "description_es": "Mejillones cocidos con vino blanco, apio, cebolla y hierbas, servidos con patatas fritas dos veces. El caldo debe ser aromático, los mejillones tiernos y las patatas crujientes.", "ingredients": ["cozze", "patate", "vino bianco", "sedano", "cipolla"], "ingredients_en": ["mussels", "potatoes", "white wine", "celery", "onion"], "ingredients_fr": ["moules", "pommes de terre", "vin blanc", "céleri", "oignon"], "ingredients_es": ["mejillones", "patatas", "vino blanco", "apio", "cebolla"], "places": ["Chez Leon Bruxelles", "Aux Armes de Bruxelles", "Le Chou de Bruxelles"]},
